# WS5-04 (failure paths). Sources: dos.library autodocs (Lock, Examine, Info, DeleteFile,
# Rename, CurrentDir fail with a null lock or DOSFALSE) and spec/appendix-stdlib.md
# (the wrappers return null or false). Expected: every call reports failure, nothing
# leaks.
# Detector: probe.py --vamos-leaks fails an Amiga run whose vamos log reports a
# library or device left open ("can't expunge … open count") or orphan AllocMem
# memory (shown to fire on the seeded program 500-seeded-leak.c in the red check).
profiles: hosted-amiga-13 hosted-amiga
expect: output
contrast: let d: bool = deleteFile("build/tmp/assessment/WS5/no/such/file"); ==> let d: bool = true;
contrast-expect: output
--- output
true true true false false false
--- contrast-output
true true true true false false
